<title>USA: IPO PRICING-Progenitor at bottom range, $7.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING-Progenitor at bottom range, $7.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		     Progenitor Inc</p>
<p>   Priced At					  $7</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range		  $7 -$8</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			2,750,000</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter		Lehman Brothers</p>
<p>NOTE: Progenitor Inc filed an initial public offering with the Securities and Exchange Commission on June 6, 1996. At that time, underwriters Lehman Brothers posted a price range of $11 to $13 for the stock. The price range was later cut to $10 to $12 but was eventually lowered to $7 to $8.</p>
</text>
